{"id":"vod_bf_31345","vodId":"31345","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"史上最强弟子兼一","name_cn":"史上最强弟子兼一","date":"2006-01-01","year":"2006","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"完结","images":{"common":"https://p.bfvp26.com/upload/vod/20230424-32/0392f6b024a8b8190d62700a8e83b040.jpg"},"summary":"白滨兼一（关智一 配音）是一个为人和善性格懦弱的内向少年，因为这性格，兼一没少受同学的欺负。为了改变悲惨的现状，兼一决定改头换面重新做人，随即加入了学校的空手道部。没想到，在社团里，兼一的境遇并没有改变，因为被社员讨厌，兼一即将被驱逐出社团，唯一幸免于难的方法就是在于社员的比武中获胜，这对于兼一来说，几乎是不可能完成的任务。　　名叫风林寺美羽（川上伦子 配音）的美少女出现在了兼一的面前，她告诉兼一，有一处名为梁山泊的道场聚集了无数的武林英雄豪杰。为了赢得比试，兼一走上了修炼的修罗之道，令他没想到的是，他平凡的人生即将被这一仓促的决定而彻底颠覆。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2026-06-10 13:55:45","playable":true,"episodeCount":50,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf4.com/video/shishangzuiqiangdizijianyi/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf4.com/video/shishangzuiqiangdizijianyi/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf4.com/video/shishangzuiqiangdizijianyi/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf4.com/video/shishangzuiqiangdizijianyi/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf4.com/video/shishangzuiqiangdizijianyi/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf4.com/video/shishangzuiqiangdizijianyi/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf4.com/video/shishangzuiqiangdizijianyi/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf4.com/video/shishangzuiqiangdizijianyi/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf4.com/video/shishangzuiqiangdizijianyi/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf4.com/video/shishangzuiqiangdizijianyi/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf4.com/video/shishangzuiqiangdizijianyi/第11集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf4.com/video/shishangzuiqiangdizijianyi/第12集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https: